  "system": {
    "identifier": "bakuton-explosion-release-absolute-death-bombing",
    "description": "<p>You create a small, volatile ball of chakra, hurling it into the air, where it flies towards a space you can see within range towards the ground and explodes in a 30-foot radius.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creatures is able to resist this jutsu’s effects</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures take 3d6 force or poison damage.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures take 6d6 force or poison damage and are Weakened.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but they take 9d6 force damage and are also Staggered.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6.</p>",
